  "text": "How to spot an unhappy agency client thirty days before they cancel their retainer. Most agency owners get blindsided when a large monthly client suddenly drops an exit email. Radio silence is the primary churn warning, but account managers rarely track dropping Slack response times. Build a Zapier workflow that monitors client message frequency and triggers alerts when communication stalls for five days. You rescue retainers before cancellations happen.",
